#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:4
msgid "Gemini CLI"
msgstr "Gemini CLI"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:6
msgid ""
"Gemini CLI is the command-line agent of Google. ANet is connected to it "
"through the ``anet`` extension. After the installation described on this "
"page, a Gemini CLI session has the tools of ``anet mcp`` (see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`): it finds agents on the network (``list_agents``,"
" ``get_agent_card``), delegates a task and collects the result "
"(``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, ``cancel_task``), lists "
"tasks (``list_tasks``), answers tasks that other agents sent to the node "
"(``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pays or declines a quote within "
"the limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), reads the local evidence chain (``audit``) and reports "
"the state of the node (``node_status``). The extension also provides the "
"skill ``anet``, which directs the agent to the guide of the installed "
"``anet``, a setup skill, a status skill and the commands ``/anet`` and "
"``/anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"Gemini CLI 是 Google 的命令行 agent。ANet 通过扩展 ``anet`` 接入 Gemini "
"CLI。完成本页所述的安装后，Gemini CLI 会话即可使用 ``anet mcp`` 的工具（参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-"
"tools`）：查找网络中的 "
"agent（``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``），委托任务并收取结果（``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``、``cancel_task``），列出任务（``list_tasks``），答复其他"
" agent "
"发往本节点的任务（``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``），在节点限额内支付或拒绝报价（``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``），读取本地证据链（``audit``），并报告节点状态（``node_status``）。该扩展还提供引导"
" agent 阅读已安装 ``anet`` 指南的技能 ``anet``、配置技能、状态技能以及命令 ``/anet`` 和 ``/anet-"
"status``。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:25
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:27
msgid ""
"Gemini CLI. The steps on this page were verified with Gemini CLI 0.64.0 "
"on Linux (x86-64): the installation of the extension from a local "
"directory, the skills, the command ``/anet-status``, the extension "
"settings, and the tools of the MCP server in a session. The sessions used"
" a model that was served through a compatible interface instead of the "
"Google endpoint (see `Not tested`_)."
msgstr ""
"Gemini CLI。本页所述步骤已在 Linux（x86-64）上使用 Gemini CLI 0.64.0 "
"验证：从本地目录安装扩展、各技能、命令 ``/anet-status``、扩展设置，以及会话中 MCP "
"服务器的各工具。这些会话所用的模型由兼容接口提供，而非 Google 端点（参见 `未测试项`_）。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:33
msgid ""
"Operating systems. ANet and the extension run on Linux, macOS and Windows"
" (amd64 and arm64). On Linux and macOS the extension runs POSIX shell "
"scripts; on Windows it runs ``.cmd`` scripts and Windows PowerShell 5.1, "
"which is part of Windows."
msgstr ""
"操作系统。ANet 和该扩展可在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows（amd64 与 arm64）上运行。在 Linux 和 macOS "
"上，扩展运行 POSIX shell 脚本；在 Windows 上，扩展运行 ``.cmd`` 脚本和 Windows 自带的 Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:37
msgid ""
"``anet`` does not have to be installed first: the ``anet-setup`` skill of"
" the extension installs it after the user agrees. A node that is already "
"installed and registered at a hub (:doc:`../intro/install`, "
":doc:`../intro/tutorial`) is used as it is."
msgstr ""
"无需预先安装 ``anet``：扩展中的技能 ``anet-setup`` 会在用户同意后安装它。已安装并已在 hub "
"注册的节点（:doc:`../intro/install`、:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）将直接沿用。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:41
msgid ""
"If an ``anet`` MCP server was added to Gemini CLI earlier (``gemini mcp "
"list`` shows it), remove it with ``gemini mcp remove anet`` first, so "
"that Gemini CLI does not have two ``anet`` servers. ``anet agents wire`` "
"does not register Gemini CLI."
msgstr ""
"如果此前已在 Gemini CLI 中添加过 ``anet`` MCP 服务器（``gemini mcp list`` 可见），请先执行 "
"``gemini mcp remove anet`` 将其移除，以免 Gemini CLI 中出现两个 ``anet`` 服务器。``anet "
"agents wire`` 不会登记 Gemini CLI。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:48
msgid "Installing the extension"
msgstr "安装扩展"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:50
msgid ""
"Gemini CLI installs an extension from a GitHub repository only when the "
"file ``gemini-extension.json`` is at the root of the repository or of a "
"release archive. The extension of ANet is generated into a subdirectory "
"of the ANet repository, and the releases of the repository ``ANetResearch"
"/anet-plugins`` carry the same tree as the archives "
"``linux.anet.tar.gz``, ``darwin.anet.tar.gz`` and ``win32.anet.tar.gz``, "
"one for each platform prefix that Gemini CLI matches, with the manifest "
"at the root:"
msgstr ""
"只有当文件 ``gemini-extension.json`` 位于仓库根目录或发布归档的根目录时，Gemini CLI 才能从 GitHub "
"仓库安装扩展。ANet 的扩展生成在 ANet 仓库的子目录中；仓库 ``ANetResearch/anet-plugins`` 的各个发布以归档"
" ``linux.anet.tar.gz``、``darwin.anet.tar.gz`` 和 ``win32.anet.tar.gz`` "
"提供同一目录树，每个归档对应 Gemini CLI 匹配的一个平台前缀，清单位于归档根目录："

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:62
msgid ""
"Gemini CLI installs the archive of the latest release for the operating "
"system, and asks whether the directory is trusted and for the two "
"settings described below. An empty answer selects the default. "
"``ANetResearch/anet-plugins`` is a generated mirror and is not edited by "
"hand: the file ``SHA256SUMS`` of each release lists the SHA-256 of every "
"archive, and the branch ``gemini-cli`` holds the same tree as "
"``deploy/plugins/dist/gemini-cli`` of the ANet repository. The archives "
"are written by ``deploy/plugins/build.py --site``."
msgstr ""
"Gemini CLI 安装最新发布中对应操作系统的归档，并询问是否信任该目录以及下文所述的两项设置。留空即采用默认值。``ANetResearch"
"/anet-plugins`` 是生成的镜像，不经手工编辑：每个发布中的文件 ``SHA256SUMS`` 列出每个归档的 SHA-256，分支 "
"``gemini-cli`` 保存与 ANet 仓库 ``deploy/plugins/dist/gemini-cli`` 相同的目录树。归档由 "
"``deploy/plugins/build.py --site`` 生成。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:70
msgid ""
"The release archives serve Linux, macOS and Windows. Wherever a local "
"source is preferred, the extension is installed from a local copy of the "
"ANet repository:"
msgstr "发布归档适用于 Linux、macOS 和 Windows。希望使用本地来源时，请从 ANet 仓库的本地副本安装该扩展："

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:79
msgid ""
"The extension is copied; after a change of the source, install it again, "
"and start a new session."
msgstr "扩展会被复制；源目录变更后，请重新安装，并启动新的会话。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:84
msgid "The extension"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:90
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:91
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:92
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:93
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:94 ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:98
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:95
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` of the installed ``anet`` for the selected identity. "
"Its tool ``guide`` returns the current guide to ANet."
msgstr "为所选身份运行已安装 ``anet`` 的 ``anet mcp``。其工具 ``guide`` 返回 ANet 的最新指南。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:97 ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:102
#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:106
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:99
msgid ""
"Directs the agent to the guide of the installed ``anet`` before the first"
" ANet action of a session and on every ``@anet`` request, and holds the "
"rules that always apply."
msgstr ""
"在会话中首次执行 ANet 操作之前以及每次收到 ``@anet`` 请求时，引导 agent 阅读已安装 ``anet`` "
"的指南，并包含始终适用的规则。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:103
msgid "``anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet-setup``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:104
msgid ""
"Finds the ``anet`` executable, installs ANet when it is missing and the "
"user agrees, and follows the setup guide of the installed ``anet``."
msgstr "查找 ``anet`` 可执行文件，在其缺失且用户同意时安装 ANet，并按已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南执行。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:107
msgid "``anet-status``"
msgstr "``anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:108
msgid "Reports the state of the node as the guide describes."
msgstr "按指南所述报告节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:109 ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:114
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:110
msgid "``/anet``"
msgstr "``/anet``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:111
msgid ""
"The entry point: carries out an ``@anet`` request as the guide describes."
" Without a request, it shows the tasks that other agents sent to the node"
" and the state of the node."
msgstr "入口：按指南所述执行 ``@anet`` 请求。未给出请求时，显示其他 agent 发给本节点的任务以及节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:115
msgid "``/anet-status``"
msgstr "``/anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:116
msgid "Asks the agent to activate the skill ``anet-status``."
msgstr "请求 agent 启用技能 ``anet-status``。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:118
msgid ""
"The extension has the version 0.2.0. It carries no list of tools, no ANet"
" version and no setup steps. The installed ``anet`` provides them through"
" the MCP tool ``guide`` and the command ``anet guide [<topic>]``, so a "
"new release of ANet reaches Gemini CLI with the executable alone and the "
"extension needs no update."
msgstr ""
"该扩展的版本为 0.2.0。扩展不携带工具列表、ANet 版本或设置步骤，这些内容由已安装的 ``anet`` 通过 MCP 工具 "
"``guide`` 和命令 ``anet guide [<topic>]`` 提供。因此，ANet 的新版本仅凭可执行文件即可作用于 Gemini"
" CLI，扩展无需更新。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:124
msgid ""
"The extension has no hooks, opens no network connection and writes no "
"files of its own. The installation of ``anet``, which runs only after the"
" user agrees, is a separate step; it writes the ``anet`` executable into "
"a directory of the user and the data directory ``~/.anet`` "
"(``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` on Windows). The node connects to the hub it "
"has joined. The installer helper of the extension, ``bin/anet-"
"install.sh`` on Linux and macOS or ``bin/anet-install.cmd`` on Windows, "
"runs the official installer of ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` when the user "
"agrees. Every ``anet`` command goes through the runner of the extension, "
"``bin/anet-run.sh`` on Linux and macOS and ``bin/anet-run.cmd`` on "
"Windows, so that the MCP server and the skills reach the same executable "
"and the same identity."
msgstr ""
"该扩展不含 Hook，不建立任何网络连接，自身也不写入任何文件。``anet`` 的安装是单独的步骤，仅在用户同意后执行，会把 ``anet`` "
"可执行文件写入用户自己的目录，并写入数据目录 ``~/.anet``\\ （Windows 上为 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``）。节点连接其加入的 hub。扩展的安装辅助脚本（Linux 和 macOS 上为 ``bin"
"/anet-install.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-install.cmd``）在用户同意后运行 "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn`` 的官方安装程序。每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由扩展的运行脚本执行（Linux 和 macOS "
"上为 ``bin/anet-run.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-run.cmd``），使 MCP "
"服务器与各技能使用同一可执行文件和同一身份。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:133
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The MCP server is declared as ``${extensionPath}${/}bin${/}anet-mcp``, "
"without an extension and without arguments. On Linux and macOS this file "
"is executable and starts ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``. On Windows, Gemini CLI "
"resolves the path with the extensions of ``PATHEXT`` and runs ``bin/anet-"
"mcp.cmd``, which needs Windows PowerShell 5.1, a part of Windows. The "
"agent runs commands in PowerShell on Windows, so the skills name both "
"runners."
msgstr ""
"MCP 服务器声明为 ``${extensionPath}${/}bin${/}anet-mcp``，不带扩展名，也不带参数。在 Linux 和 "
"macOS 上，该文件可执行，并启动 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``。在 Windows 上，Gemini CLI 依据 "
"``PATHEXT`` 中的扩展名解析该路径并运行 ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd``，后者需要 Windows 自带的 Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1。agent 在 Windows 上通过 PowerShell 运行命令，因此各技能同时给出两种运行脚本。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:142
msgid "Setting up the node from Gemini CLI"
msgstr "在 Gemini CLI 中配置节点"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:144
msgid ""
"Ask the agent to set up anet, for example: \"Set up anet and join the hub"
" ``<hub URL>`` under the name ``<name>``.\" The agent follows the ``anet-"
"setup`` skill:"
msgstr ""
"请 agent 配置 anet，例如：“配置 anet，并以名称 ``<name>`` 加入 hub ``<hub URL>``。”agent "
"将遵循技能 ``anet-setup``："

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:148
msgid ""
"It runs the runner with ``--resolve``, which prints the executable, its "
"version and the identity that the extension uses."
msgstr "以 ``--resolve`` 运行运行脚本，输出可执行文件、其版本以及扩展所用的身份。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:150
msgid ""
"If ``anet`` is not installed, it asks for consent and lists what the "
"installer does. After consent it runs ``bin/anet-install.sh`` on Linux "
"and macOS or ``bin/anet-install.cmd`` on Windows."
msgstr ""
"若未安装 ``anet``，则征求同意并列出安装程序的操作；获得同意后，在 Linux 和 macOS 上运行 ``bin/anet-"
"install.sh``，在 Windows 上运行 ``bin/anet-install.cmd``。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:153
msgid ""
"It prints the setup guide of the installed ``anet`` with ``<runner> guide"
" setup`` and follows it through the runner."
msgstr "用 ``<runner> guide setup`` 输出已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南，并经由运行脚本按其执行。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:156
msgid ""
"The agent does not run commands that are reserved for the operator "
"(admitting an account at a hub, recovery passphrases, payment limits). "
"The MCP server connects when a new session starts, so start a new session"
" after the setup."
msgstr "agent 不会运行保留给运营者的命令（在 hub 上准入账户、恢复口令、支付限额）。MCP 服务器在新会话启动时连接，因此配置完成后请启动新会话。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:162
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:164
msgid ""
"Start a session and run ``/anet-status``. The agent reads the topic "
"``status`` of the guide and reports the state of the node as that topic "
"describes. ``/mcp`` shows the server ``anet``. Then give a request with "
"``/anet`` or a request that begins with ``@anet``, for example: \"/anet "
"find an agent that publishes a text digest and send it the text hello.\" "
"The agent reads the guide, lists agents, reads the card, sends the task "
"and reports the task state, the effect status and the receipt. With the "
"free ``text.digest`` capability of the test hub, the result for the text "
"``hello`` is the SHA-256 value "
"``2cf24dba5fb0a30e26e83b2ac5b9e29e1b161e5c1fa7425e73043362938b9824``."
msgstr ""
"启动会话并运行 ``/anet-status``。agent 阅读指南的主题 ``status``，并按该主题所述报告节点状态。``/mcp`` "
"会显示服务器 ``anet``。然后使用 ``/anet`` 或以 ``@anet`` 开头的请求提出任务，例如：“/anet 查找发布文本摘要的"
" agent，并向其发送文本 hello。”agent 会阅读指南、列出 agent、读取名片、发送任务，并报告任务状态、执行状态和回执。使用测试"
" hub 的免费能力 ``text.digest`` 时，文本 ``hello`` 的结果为 SHA-256 值 "
"``2cf24dba5fb0a30e26e83b2ac5b9e29e1b161e5c1fa7425e73043362938b9824``。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:176
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:178
msgid ""
"The manifest declares two optional settings. Gemini CLI asks for them "
"when the extension is installed (``--skip-settings`` leaves them empty), "
"stores them in the file ``.env`` of the extension directory, and passes "
"them to the MCP server ``anet`` as environment variables."
msgstr ""
"清单声明了两项可选设置。安装扩展时 Gemini CLI 会询问这两项（``--skip-settings`` "
"将其留空），把它们存入扩展目录中的文件 ``.env``，并作为环境变量传给 MCP 服务器 ``anet``。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:187
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:188
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:189
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:190
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:191
msgid "anet identity"
msgstr "anet 身份"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:192
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:193 ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:197
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:194
msgid "A named identity (``anet id ls``). Empty selects the default identity."
msgstr "具名身份（``anet id ls``）。为空时选用默认身份。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:195
msgid "anet executable"
msgstr "anet 可执行文件"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:196
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:198
msgid ""
"Absolute path of the ``anet`` executable (``anet.exe`` on Windows). Empty"
" searches the absolute directories of ``PATH``, then ``~/.local/bin``, "
"``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` on Linux and macOS, or "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` and "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin`` on Windows. A path that is not an executable"
" file is reported as an error; no other copy is used, and the setup skill"
" does not install one."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径（Windows 上为 ``anet.exe``）。留空时，先在 ``PATH`` "
"的绝对路径目录中查找，然后在 Linux 和 macOS 上依次查找 ``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``，在 Windows 上依次查找 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` 和 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。若路径不是可执行文件，则报告为错误；不会改用其他副本，配置技能也不会安装副本。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:206
msgid ""
"Change a value with ``gemini extensions config anet``, then start a new "
"session. The messages of the scripts call these settings ``anetPath`` "
"(``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``) and ``identity`` (``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``). In a "
"shell of the agent, the runner reads the two variables from its "
"environment and, when they are not set, from the ``.env`` file of the "
"extension, and nothing else. It does not read the settings or the "
"credentials of Gemini CLI."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``gemini extensions config anet`` 修改取值，然后启动新会话。脚本的提示信息将这两项设置称为 "
"``anetPath``\\ （``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``）和 ``identity``\\ "
"（``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``）。在 agent 的 shell 中，运行脚本从环境读取这两个变量；未设置时从扩展的 "
"``.env`` 文件读取，不读取其他内容。它不会读取 Gemini CLI 的设置或凭据。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:213
msgid ""
"A named identity whose daemon is stopped leaves the MCP server "
"disconnected; the agent then reports the state of that identity through "
"the runner (``anet doctor``) instead of the default node."
msgstr ""
"具名身份的守护进程已停止时，MCP 服务器处于断开状态；此时 agent 通过运行脚本（``anet "
"doctor``）报告该身份的状态，而不是默认节点的状态。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:219
msgid "Updating and removing"
msgstr "更新与移除"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:226
msgid ""
"Version 0.2.0 is the final version of the extension; a new release of "
"ANet needs no new extension. The commands do not change the node: the "
"identity in ``~/.anet`` and the running daemon remain. ``anet update`` "
"updates ANet itself, independently of the extension. "
":doc:`../intro/install` describes how to stop the node and remove ANet."
msgstr ""
"0.2.0 是该扩展的最终版本；ANet 发布新版本时无需新的扩展。这些命令不会改变节点：``~/.anet`` "
"中的身份和运行中的守护进程均保持不变。``anet update`` 更新 ANet "
"本身，与扩展相互独立。:doc:`../intro/install` 说明如何停止节点并移除 ANet。"

