msgid "The extension gallery of Gemini CLI."
msgstr "Gemini CLI 的扩展库。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:244
msgid ""
"The complete ``anet-setup`` procedure. In the non-interactive mode "
"(``--yolo``), Gemini CLI 0.64.0 ran ``bin/anet-install.sh`` of an earlier"
" version of the extension and installed ``anet``, and then refused the "
"later commands of ``bin/anet-run.sh`` with ``Tool execution denied by "
"policy``; the interactive mode was not tested. The node was started and "
"registered in a terminal instead."
msgstr ""
"完整的 ``anet-setup`` 流程。在非交互模式（``--yolo``）下，Gemini CLI 0.64.0 运行了扩展较早版本的 "
"``bin/anet-install.sh`` 并安装了 ``anet``，随后以 ``Tool execution denied by "
"policy`` 拒绝了 ``bin/anet-run.sh`` 的后续命令；交互模式未经测试。节点改为在终端中启动并注册。"

#: ../../agents/gemini-cli.rst:250
msgid ""
"The extension on macOS and on Windows. The Windows launch through ``bin"
"/anet-mcp.cmd`` follows from the bundle of Gemini CLI 0.65.0, and the "
"Windows runner is tested with PowerShell."
msgstr ""
"该扩展在 macOS 和 Windows 上的运行。经由 ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd`` 在 Windows 上启动的方式依据 "
"Gemini CLI 0.65.0 的程序包得出，Windows 运行脚本已用 PowerShell 测试。"

